  "notes": [
    "SAFE and CAUTION selectors are anchored on data-*, data-testid, role and id only: the measured class fragments were empty and the class list is Tailwind-style utility classes.",
    "monaco-editor (.monaco-editor), xterm (.xterm), iframe, canvas and webview were absent in the capture that produced this profile; their doNotTouch entries come from the design contract, not from measurement, and ship even without evidence.",
    "data-v4-* selectors carry a schema-version prefix and are the first candidates to break on a ZCode upgrade, which is why supportedVersions gates the full theme.",
    "fingerprint.digest 是首采基线；observedDigests 记录同版本两次实测的语义指纹。两次采集仅差一个可选表面属性对（- data-cron-task-icon，+ data-composer-trailing-actions），故指纹漂移在证据审计里只作为 warning 记录，兼容身份由 supportedVersions + requiredSelectors + 渲染器 URL 族承载。",
    "neverSampledAttributes 是运行期脱敏名单的记录（清单 ⊆ 拒绝集）：清单上每个属性名都被 ZCODE_ATTRIBUTE_VALUE_DENY_SOURCE 覆盖，采集器一律不记录其属性值，证据审计用它反查采集是否失守；同一条正则覆盖的其余名字（如任何以 value/model/label/session/provider 结尾的 data-*）不必在此重复列出。",
    "计数与开关类属性（data-row-count、data-window-row-count、data-render-unit-count、data-total-row-count、data-projection-seq、data-input-routing、data-restored-unvalidated、aria-valuenow、aria-valuemin）确实被采样，因为它们的值是受限的非内容 token（字符集闸门 + 48 字符上限 + 每属性最多 8 条样本），不携带用户状态，且 DOM Map 的计数证据正依赖它们。属性值采样是按名字脱敏的：任何将来新增的状态型属性名，都要同步补进 ZCODE_ATTRIBUTE_VALUE_DENY_SOURCE。"
  ]
